If you polymorph into a monster which can eat a given ring, and that ring 
has an intrinsic you don't have, then you have a 1/3 chance of getting
that intrinsic.

What monsters can eat what rings?  Here's a repost of something I gave a
while ago. Everything applies to nh3.1.0:

Ring Name   Material   Eaten by
---------   --------   --------
wooden      wood       Gelatinous cubes
granite     mineral
black onyx  mineral
moonstone   mineral
tiger eye   gemstone
jade        gemstone
agate       gemstone
topaz       gemstone
sapphire    gemstone
ruby        gemstone
diamond     gemstone
pearl       iron       Metallivores
iron        iron       Metallivores
brass       copper     Metallivores
copper      copper     Metallivores
silver      silver     Metallivores
gold        gold       Metallivores
ivory       0          Gelatinous cubes
emerald     gemstone
wire        iron       Metallivores
engagement  iron       Metallivores

There are three monsters which are Metallivores:
  - rock moles
  - rust monster
  - xorn



